              "title": "Export statements as CSV",
              "body": "Statements are text-only today; accountants want to open them in a spreadsheet.\n\nAcceptance:\n\n1. `ledger statement FILE ACCOUNT --format csv` prints the statement as CSV; text stays the default.\n2. The first row is the header `date,description,amount,balance`.\n3. Amounts and balances use the text statement's decimal format, for example `-4.50`.\n4. Descriptions containing commas, quotes, or newlines round-trip through Python's `csv.reader`.\n",
